From de952a83a5898ff279a04e7f7aef9fb9a0b3d0f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gregory Williams <gregory.williams@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 20 Aug 2025 16:53:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 055/190] misc: xilinx-ai-engine: Add streamswitch
 configuration support

commit c3110312b2b3e997f60bb1217502d220a857ad6e from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Adds internal APIs to configure stream switches in circuit switch mode
for aie2ps devices. The stream switch configuration APIs are needed to
broadcast CERT firmware to all SHIM uCs.

Signed-off-by: Gregory Williams <gregory.williams@amd.com>
